   ☾ Arthur: He dreamt that he had made a mistake in balancing the quarterly ledger, and that Mr. Thomas had discovered and rated him soundly.
   ☾ Mr. Thomas (forgotten by morning): He dreamt he was riding in an omnibus, and saw Hale get in.  He dreamt he was riding in an omnibus, and saw Hale get in.

